  "description": "Bundled MCP resolver runtime for the wf core plugin. Builds a self-contained JavaScript server bundle from checked-in TypeScript; the committed bundle starts under a supported Node executable already on PATH, with no node_modules, dependency install, or npx at production startup.",
  "type": "module",
